  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Mental Health Academy for Zimbabwe Youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project sparks a youth-driven movement for mental wellbeing in Zimbabwe&#xfffd;s urban slums. At its heart is the Mental Health Academy&#xfffd;built by and for young people&#xfffd;where youth are trained as mental health champions equipped with tools in advocacy, leadership, and care. These champions lead bold initiatives in their communities, breaking stigma and building support. Through youth advisory boards, young voices are brought into decision-making spaces, shaping long term change. By challenging the political, social, and cultural barriers around mental health, the project sets a new youth-led direction for how to tackle the youth mental health crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
